@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title 41 - Test Result States
state "NOT EXECUTED" as Pending
state "PASS" as Pass
state "FAIL" as Fail
state "BLOCKED" as Blocked
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Blocked : prerequisite unavailable
Pending --> Pass : executed; expectations satisfied
Pending --> Fail : executed; expectations violated
Blocked --> Pending : obstacle resolved; ready to execute
Fail --> Pass : correction and fresh retest pass
note bottom of Fail : Defect lifecycle is recorded separately
@enduml
